Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/lib/vms_term_sock.c
Line: 150
Function: main
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: TermBuff is uninitialized when passed to OPENSSL_strcasecmp in the while condition. strcasecmp reads until a NUL byte; without initialization, it may scan past the 80-byte buffer, causing an out-of-bounds read.

